{"name": "BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Beastopia, the animals that survived the apocalypse learned a few useful tricks: how to carry a gun, fix a machine, build a shelter and get out before somebody takes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the ruins, search abandoned streets and dangerous laboratories, collect supplies, and make it back to your shelter with your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But the old world is not empty. Stalkers roam the ruins. Hostile creatures guard valuable supplies. And other raiders are chasing the same prize.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Loot. Fight. Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/5ee73733cf33cfb8de3ba914faf6243b.poster.avif?t=1791470272\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/5ee73733cf33cfb8de3ba914faf6243b.webm?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/5ee73733cf33cfb8de3ba914faf6243b.mp4?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every raid is a choice. Leave early with the loot you have, or go deeper to find better loot. Open boxes, fight monsters, avoid other raiders or fight them. Just make sure you get out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Are Not Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/77621a39926ab2dc7846cc6bb802b960.poster.avif?t=1791470272\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/77621a39926ab2dc7846cc6bb802b960.webm?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/77621a39926ab2dc7846cc6bb802b960.mp4?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone or with a team. Other players may hide from you, chase you, or ask for copartion. Keep looking around. Watch your back. Nobody is worth trusting. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use What You Find</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/30d09871db30599ad941d792bef914cb.poster.avif?t=1791470272\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/30d09871db30599ad941d792bef914cb.webm?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/30d09871db30599ad941d792bef914cb.mp4?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring home weapons, armor, attachments, materials, and strange items. Sell what you do not need. Craft what you do need. Even junk can become useful gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make Your Hideout Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/a4c3a8ec9c74d666ba20467a9f610387.poster.avif?t=1791470272\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/a4c3a8ec9c74d666ba20467a9f610387.webm?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/extras/a4c3a8ec9c74d666ba20467a9f610387.mp4?t=1791470272\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your facilities, make better items, improve your stats, and prepare for harder raids. The more you survive, the stronger you become.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS is a 2D PvPvE animal extraction shooter set after humanity\u2019s extinction. Venture into ruined cities and dangerous laboratories, search for valuable supplies, and return safely to your shelter with your loot.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867740/c5863a3cff96c9cfc21cbb7f6e092dcd4e13853b/header.jpg?t=1791470272", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Extraction Shooter", "Gun Customization", "Massively Multiplayer", "Action Roguelike", "Looter Shooter"], "developers": "OFFMOON Inc.", "publishers": "OFFMOON Inc.", "release_date": "Dec 7, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4867740", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/LkOF-3F65VI", "first_seen": 1791410400.0, "review_rank": 22}